{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Love: Iberian Legends</strong> is a visual novel where you flirt with Spanish folklore creatures, save (or doom) humanity, and, if you earn their trust, unlock <strong>their true monstrous form!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/extras/234be24e512c8959fb017b0d5e82f22f.avif?t=1760105621\" width=621 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet five romanceable myths, each with their own drama, secrets, and a tendency to snack on humans from time to time ;). Your choices decide whether you end up in love, betrayed, or just\u2026 obliterated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/extras/9522a206d037211a8101220be8fd556e.avif?t=1760105621\" width=621 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five romanceable Iberian legends</strong> \u2013 from mischievous gods to broody monsters. Flirt at your own risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock their true monster forms</strong> \u2013 if they trust you enough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15+ endings</strong> \u2013 happy, tragic, weird\u2026 and a few you\u2019ll probably regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that matter</strong> \u2013 decide who to trust, who to love, and whether humanity survives your love life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original art style</strong> \u2013 Iberian myths have never looked this good!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/extras/fce8ae1cd0606691f0b54f2465123b23.avif?t=1760105621\" width=1092 height=1544 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014060?t=1760105621","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014060?t=1760105621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/d47f85c7b8140794976262508bba4eb8ea630406/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760105621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/d47f85c7b8140794976262508bba4eb8ea630406/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760105621","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythic Love: Iberian Legends</strong> is a visual novel where you flirt with Spanish folklore creatures, save (or doom) humanity, and, if you earn their trust, unlock <strong>their true monstrous form!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014060/extras/234be24e512c8959fb017b0d5e82f22f.avif?t=1760105621\" width=621 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet five romanceable myths, each with their own drama, secrets, and a tendency to snack on humans from time to time ;). Your choices decide whether you end up in love, betrayed, or just\u2026 obliterated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct